<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-380] Cascading and scrooge builds fail when using thrift 0.9.0</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-380</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This is caused by a transitive dependency on libthrift 0.7.0 from elephantbird. The solution is to add thrift as an explicit (but provided) dependency to those projects.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12895906">PARQUET-380</key>
            <summary>Cascading and scrooge builds fail when using thrift 0.9.0</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
